      "description": "Story:\n SFCC-126 | \nPriority:\n High | \nLabels:\n @SFCC-126 @account @p0\nComponent:\n My Account — Registration | \nOwner:\n Squad A\nNote: EU international uses Global-e for checkout (REG-006), but account registration and authentication remain managed by SFCC. This test validates SFCC account creation only.\nObjective:\nVerify registering on the EU international storefront (ZimmermannEUIntl) creates an account on the global SFCC customer list so the same credentials authenticate on ZimmermannAU without re-registration.\nPreconditions:\nTest email has never been registered in the target SFCC environment.\nSFCC-126 is deployed (global customer list configured).\nTester is not authenticated — fresh browser session.\nreCAPTCHA is set to test-bypass mode (CRM-008).\nTest Steps — Part 1: Register on EU international storefront\n#\nAction\nTest Data\nExpected Result\n1\nNavigate to the EU international storefront\nhttps://zimmermann-test.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/en-ch/\nPage loads at /en-ch/\n2\nDidomi consent banner — click \"Decline tracking\"\n—\nBanner dismisses\n3\nClick \"Account\" in the site header\n—\nNavigates to .../en-ch/login\n4\nClick \"Create Account\" link\n—\nNavigates to .../en-ch/registration\n5\nIn the \"First name\" field\nQA_EUIntl\nField populated\n6\nIn the \"Last name\" field\nGlobalTestEUIntl\nField populated\n7\nIn the \"Email\" field\nqa-global-euintl-{timestamp}@zimmermann-test.com\nField populated\n8\nIn the \"Password\" field\nValid password (CRM-006)\nField populated; show/hide toggle present (CRM-016)\n9\nIn the \"Confirm password\" field\nSame as step 8\nNo mismatch error\n10\nLeave marketing opt-in unchecked\nDefault unchecked (CRM-007)\nCheckbox unchecked\n11\nClick \"Create Account\" button\n—\nSFCC creates record on global customer list\n12\nVerify redirect to EU international account dashboard\n—\nURL: .../en-ch/account; greeting \"Hi QA_EUIntl\" (CRM-020)\n13\nClick \"Logout\" in left-hand nav\n—\nSession cleared; no auth cookies remain\nTest Steps — Part 2: Authenticate on AU storefront\n#\nAction\nTest Data\nExpected Result\n14\nNavigate to the AU storefront\nhttps://zimmermann-test.sfdc-8tgtt5-ecom1.exp-delivery.com/\nPage loads at root AU URL\n15\nDidomi consent banner — click \"Decline tracking\"\n—\nBanner dismisses\n16\nClick \"Account\" in the site header\n—\nNavigates to .../login\n17\nIn the \"Email\" field\nSame email from step 7\nField populated\n18\nIn the \"Password\" field\nSame password from step 8\nField populated\n19\nClick \"Sign In\" button\n—\nSFCC authenticates against global customer list\n20\nWait for navigation to AU account dashboard\n—\nURL: .../account\n21\nVerify personalised welcome message\nExpected first name: QA_EUIntl\nGreeting reads \"Hi QA_EUIntl\" (CRM-020); no error\nPass Criteria:\n Customer authenticates on AU storefront using EU International-registered credentials. Account not scoped to ZimmermannEUIntl even with Global-e checkout.",
