      "key": "SFCC-109",
      "summary": "Base Product Catalogue Setup",
      "description": "As a\n Site Admin, \n\n\nI want\n the master catalogue and per-site storefront catalogues configured in SFCC Business Manager, \n\n\nso that\n each storefront has a structured catalogue foundation for product assignment, category navigation, and merchandising.\nThe master catalogue ID is zimmermann-catalog. Each of the 8 storefronts has a dedicated storefront catalogue. The master catalogue assignment linking storefront categories to master products must be done in Business Manager.\nNote: Mani's TSD lists 7 storefront catalogues with a single US entry. Per last week (week of 30 June), this has been updated to \n8 storefronts splitting US into domestic and international.\n Catalogue IDs below reflect this.",
