      "description": "As a\n Site Admin, \nI want\n per-site inventory lists configured in SFCC Business Manager and assigned to each storefront, \nso that \ninventory availability data received from NewStore via MuleSoft can be imported and displayed correctly per region.\nThis is just the base inventory setup - inventory integration is a separate user story (NewStore). \nPlease note, US Domestic and US International storefronts share the same inventory.",
