  "description": "**As a** Site Admin,\n\n**I want** to configure the correct locales and URL structure for each of the 8 Zimmermann storefronts in SFCC Business Manager,\n\n**so that** each storefront serves the correct language(s) and operates on the correct URL path per market.\n\n----\n\nThis story is split out from SFCC-48 (8 Storefronts Setup) to allow storefront creation to proceed independently while locale and URL configuration is finalised. \n\nThis covers locale assignment per storefront, EU multi-language locale setup, and the URL path structure across all 8 storefronts.\n\n|**Storefront Name**|**SFCC Site ID**|**Locale(s)**|**URL Path**|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|Australia (AU)|ZimmermannAU|en_AU|/en-au|\n|US Domestic|ZimmermannUS|en|**Root URL**\n(/us will be redirected to root URL)|\n|US International|ZimmermannUSIntl|en_CA|/en-ca|\n|UK (Domestic)|ZimmermannUK|en_GB|/uk|\n|EU (Domestic)|ZimmermannEU|en_FR (default)\nfr_FR\nit_IT\nes_ES|/en-eu\n/fr-eu\n/es-eu\n/it-eu|\n|EU (International)|ZimmermannEUIntl|en_CH|/en-ch|\n|Hong Kong (International)|ZimmermannHK|en_HK|/hk|\n|Middle East (International)|ZimmermannME|en_AE|/en-ae|",
